{% extends "base.html.twig" %}

{% block title %}Game{% endblock %}

{% block main %}
    
    <h1>Game</h1>

    <div>
        <h3>Info</h3>
        <p>This card game is called 21. It's played between two parts, the player(you) and the bank(computer).
            The goal is to beat the bank by having a higher total value without exceeding 21.
            The game starts off with you recieving a card.
            Now you have two options, either you draw another card or you stay.
            If you choose to stay the turn goes over to the bank.
            The bank is not as smart as you and will always draw another card while the total value is below 17.
            When the bank is done it's time to determine the winner.
            If both exceed 21 it's a tie, otherwise the highest value wins but remember the bank always wins if values are the same!
        </p>
    </div>

    <div>
        <h3>Game review</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>(1) Player recieves one card</li>
            <li>(2) Player choose to draw or stay</li>
            <li>(2.1) Draw</li>
            <p>- Player recieve another card --> (2)</p>
            <p>- If player exceeds 21 --> (3)</p>
            <li>(2.2) Stay</li>
            <p>- Player holds cards --> (3)</p>
            <li>(3) Bank's turn</li>
            <p>- Bank draw card</p>
            <p>- If below 17 --> (3)</p>
            <p>- If above 17 --> (4)</p>
            <li>(4) Determine winner</li>
            <p>- Show result for round</p>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div>
        <a href="{{ path('doc') }}" class="button">Doc</a>
        <a href="{{ path('init') }}" class="button">Play game</a>
    </div>
{% endblock %}